From 920aaad4f2055c596403a81f64ca2eafe53e97be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:17:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] In-game menu: a control let go while it is open is let go
 in the game

DraStic sits inside SDL_PollEvent for the whole menu, so the release of a
direction, button, stick, hat, or stylus never reaches it. After Resume the
game keeps that control held. Releases of controls that were already held,
and the stick and hat's position at close, are queued for the next polls.
Presses that only drove the menu are not passed on.

Co-authored-by: JorreFog <JorreFog@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit ddd892b9f3e436aa1808942be3ccfa5723949402)
