Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:09:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] 0.5.0-beta.1-rocknixds.13: five upstream fixes for
 ROCKNIXDS

From upstream's branches, -x, conflicts resolved for our line:
- quit-save keeps the previous resume state when the new one does not
  finish (the early unlink is gone; our CPU boost stays);
- a control released while the in-game menu is open is released in the
  game (the menu's drain loop hands SDL_QUIT back, so a quit sent with
  the menu open still reaches DraStic);
- realpath's buffer is PATH_MAX, so a fortified build does not abort;
- NNDDSS shaders: SCREEN_RES_SCALE from the frame's width (BL#76);
- Retro tiles without the blown-out half.

Not taken, already on this line: 457ac28 (our 5e14c95), 8ae97f7 (our
af8944a and the .12 quit handling), 452a9fd (hr_recip covers 1023
lines). 425a416 follows a BananaOS-only setting.

